00:35:15.750 --> 00:35:17.625
So, you know, certainly
some of our customers

00:35:17.625 --> 00:35:19.790
run parts of LightStep
on other Cloud providers.

00:35:19.790 --> 00:35:21.460
They run it on bare metal--

00:35:21.460 --> 00:35:23.170
